{"id":63042,"mal_id":63042,"title":"Meitantei Precure!","englishTitle":"Star Detective Precure!","title_english":"Star Detective Precure!","alternative_titles":{"synonyms":["TanPuri"],"en":"Star Detective Precure!","ja":"名探偵プリキュア！"},"synopsis":"On her 14th birthday, Anna Akechi, a second-year junior high student from the town of Makoto Mirai, encounters a fairy named Pochitan, who suddenly sends her back from 2027 to the same town nearly three decades earlier. Stranded in 1999, Anna crosses paths with Mikuru Kobayashi, a girl her age who dreams of becoming a renowned detective.\n\nAlmost immediately, a bride becomes the victim of a mysterious theft when her tiara vanishes. Refusing to stand by, Anna and Mikuru awaken the ability to transform into magical girls known as Pretty Cure, taking it upon themselves to uncover the truth behind the incident. Their investigation leads them to an elusive group calling themselves the Phantom Thieves, whom they confront as the group continues their thievery.\n\nAs further incidents loom, Anna and Mikuru resolve to stand against the Phantom Thieves and prevent future crimes. They soon learn that the stolen items contain Makoto Jewels—sources of power the Phantom Thieves seek for their own ends. However, that same power is also vital to Pochitan, who needs it to return Anna to her original time. Hoping to prevent this power from falling into the wrong hands, the two press forward, balancing their duty to protect others with Anna's desire to find her way home.\n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]","synopsis_es":"En su cumpleaños número 14, Anna Akechi, una estudiante de segundo año de secundaria de la ciudad de Makoto Mirai, se encuentra con un hada llamada Pochitan, quien de repente la envía de regreso desde 2027 a la misma ciudad casi tres décadas antes. Varada en 1999, Anna se cruza en su camino con Mikuru Kobayashi, una niña de su edad que sueña con convertirse en una detective de renombre.\n\nCasi de inmediato, una novia se convierte en víctima de un misterioso robo cuando su tiara desaparece. Al negarse a quedarse al margen, Anna y Mikuru despiertan la capacidad de transformarse en chicas mágicas conocidas como Pretty Cure, y se encargan de descubrir la verdad detrás del incidente. Su investigación los lleva a un grupo esquivo que se hace llamar los Ladrones Fantasmas, a quienes se enfrentan mientras el grupo continúa con sus robos.\n\nA medida que se avecinan más incidentes, Anna y Mikuru deciden enfrentarse a los Phantom Thieves y prevenir futuros crímenes. Pronto descubren que los artículos robados contienen joyas Makoto, fuentes de poder que los Phantom Thieves buscan para sus propios fines. Sin embargo, ese mismo poder también es vital para Pochitan, quien lo necesita para devolver a Anna a su tiempo original. Con la esperanza de evitar que este poder caiga en las manos equivocadas, los dos siguen adelante, equilibrando su deber de proteger a los demás con el deseo de Anna de encontrar el camino a casa.\n\n[Escrito por MAL Rewrite]","type":"TV","media_type":"tv","status":"currently_airing","averageEpisodeDurationSeconds":1447,"average_episode_duration":1447,"startDate":"2026-02-01","start_date":"2026-02-01","endDate":null,"end_date":null,"season":"winter","year":2026,"start_season":{"year":2026,"season":"winter"},"episodes":null,"num_episodes":null,"score":7.67,"mean":7.67,"numListUsers":9518,"num_list_users":9518,"genres":[{"id":1,"name":"Action"},{"id":39,"name":"Detective"},{"id":66,"name":"Mahou Shoujo"},{"id":7,"name":"Mystery"},{"id":78,"name":"Time Travel"}],"studios":[{"id":18,"name":"Toei Animation"}],"pictures":[],"backdrop_url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/bOgsRcvQcetWXtVnPgKtYYf9aSV.jpg","logo_url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/j0QGp7ZpB1Fpwrz24JVtJ8H73Tc.png","tmdb_id":"306721","tmdb_updated_at":"2026-11-19T14:49:23.563Z","images":{"jpg":{"image_url":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1706/154944.webp","large_image_url":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/17