 of the drama club. But right before the performance a very special costume goes missing from the club office.","title_es":"¡No hagas suposiciones!"},{"episode":10,"title":"Solve the Mystery of the Painting!","aired":"2026-04-05T08:30:00+09:00","thumbnail":"https://simkl.in/episodes/19/19791817fedc054775_w.webp","description":"A client comes to the CUREtto Detective Agency, asking them to help solve a mystery.","title_es":"¡Resuelve el misterio de la pintura!"},{"episode":11,"title":"Cure Arcana Shadow Appears!","aired":"2026-04-12T08:30:00+09:00","thumbnail":"https://simkl.in/episodes/19/1983972597da674919_w.webp","description":"A calling card from the Phantom Thieves’ Guild is sent to the Hosho Art Museum. Anna and Mikuru arrive on the scene, there Luluka strikes a conversation with Anna while in the Starlight Princess display room.","title_es":"¡Aparece la cura Arcana Shadow!"},{"episode":12,"title":"The Secret of Cure Arcana Shadow!","aired":"2026-04-19T08:30:00+09:00","thumbnail":"https://simkl.in/episodes/19/1987490584010e8c36_w.webp","description":null,"title_es":"¡El secreto de curar la sombra arcana!"},{"episode":13,"title":"Star Detectives vs Thieves","aired":"2026-04-26T08:30:00+09:00","thumbnail":"https://simkl.in/episodes/19/19919075cc5615c698_w.webp","description":null,"title_es":"Detectives estrella contra ladrones"},{"episode":14,"title":"Pochitan's First Outing!","aired":"2026-05-03T08:30:00+09:00","thumbnail":"https://simkl.in/episodes/19/19935837f25ab1c211_w.webp","description":null,"title_es":"¡La primera salida de Pochitán!"},{"episode":15,"title":"The Secret of Luluka Moria","aired":"2026-05-10T08:30:00+09:00","thumbnail":"https://simkl.in/episodes/20/200050638b4818796b_w.webp","description":null,"title_es":"El secreto de Luluka Moria"},{"episode":16,"title":"Detective Ellie's Case Book?","aired":"2026-05-17T08:30:00+09:00","thumbnail":"https://simkl.in/episodes/20/2002217791c9b09be4_w.webp","description":null,"title_es":"¿El libro de casos de 